# KDF generated web artifacts.
#
# The build unzips a downloaded archive into web/kdf/, and the layout varies:
# build_config.json declares `web/kdf/bin`, while current archives carry their
# own `kdf/` root and land in `web/kdf/kdf/{bin,res}`. Enumerating spellings
# has already failed once â€” a 32 MB kdflib_bg.wasm was committed in b84ba3c59
# and removed in 7a9a05363 â€” so ignore everything under web/kdf/ and re-include
# only res/, which is hand-maintained wrapper source that must stay tracked.
web/kdf/*
!web/kdf/res/

